factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and slides say the auction was cancelled 'yesterday' (நேற்று), but the article does not state the day of the cancellation in relation to the current date; it names 13th and 20th (last-week cancellations) and says 'நேற்று' only in the sense of the most recent day — this timing reference is not clearly supported and conflicts with the 13th/20th dates given in the article.
  The reel_script states the auction is held on Tuesdays 'at the Namakkal Namagiripettai RCMS centre' and omits the article's explanation that the cancellation on 13th and the 20th (Ayudha Puja) were also cancelled, which is a relevant fact about the repeated cancellations.
  The caption date line states 'நாள்: அக். 27, 2026 (செவ்வாய்க்கிழமை)' as the event date, which conflicts with the article's cancellation dates (13th and 20th) and the claim the cancellation was yesterday; the date is not supported by the article.
  The reel_script and caption say the cancellation was caused only by lower arrivals due to rain, but the article also attributes the cancellation of the 20th to Ayudha Puja, a cause omitted/mixed in the reel_script narrative.
